     <rdf:li>help, conversation, internet, assistant, beautiful, friendly, agent, online, consultant, helpdesk, technical support, telephone, cheerful, asian, communication, smiling, phone, workplace, talking, centre, customer, call, people, technology, headset, business, computer, young, support, person, work, group, worker, professional, office, happy, telemarketing, service, teamwork, corporate, headphone, team, center, woman, girl, representative, female, businesswoman, operator, sitting</rdf:li>
